Year 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532872/5328720313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2012-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/532872/5328720312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"SPARC reported a significant financial turnaround in FY26, driven by the recognition of income from a Priority Review Voucher (PRV) for Sezaby. The company has focused its R&D efforts on oncology and immunology, specifically targeting ADCs and autoimmune pathways. Management has implemented cost-rationalization measures, including reducing its US footprint and consolidating laboratory facilities. The company also successfully raised capital through a preferential issue of warrants to the promoter group. SPARC is focusing its R&D strategy on oncology and immunology, specifically targeting antibody-drug conjugates (ADCs) and dermatology autoimmune conditions.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects to complete its funding plan in the first half of the 2026 calendar year.","quote":"we are in the process of finalizing a funding plan to extend the cash window to FY '28 and hope to complete that process in the first half of this calendar year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The market for pediatric rare disease vouchers has seen robust demand while supply has decreased, driving transaction values above $100 million.","quote":"The demand remained robust while the supply situation is beginning to shrink, resulting in transaction values going north of $100 million.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Operational spend is projected to decrease from $31 million last year to $29 million this year.","quote":"From 31 million last year, we are projected to go down to 29 million this year, even though we plan to scale our clinical program significantly.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company sold its Priority Review Voucher (PRV) for USD 195 million.","quote":"The PRV, being a transferable instrument, was subsequently sold by the Company on April 30, 2026 for USD 195 million.","doc_kind":"annual_report","doc_date":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d613e9d5-80ef-4e80-96ae-455b4ca8043c.pdf"},{"claim":"The company has accumulated over $45 million in promoter-backed debt as of Q2 FY26.","quote":"Plus we've been funding our early development using promoter-backed debt, which is cumulatively 45 million-plus now as of Q2 FY '26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The company faces potential regulatory hurdles for its PDP-716 product due to compliance issues at the finished product manufacturing site.","quote":"we may not be completely out of the woods here, as the finished product manufacturing site has compliance issues which require further remediation.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf"},{"claim":"The development pathway for vodobatinib in CML remains challenging due to the evolving competitive landscape.","quote":"we've negotiated a protocol for a registration program in second-line CML with FDA, but the pathway remains challenging.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company expects safety and preliminary efficacy data for the SCD-153 Phase 1B trial by the fourth quarter of 2026.","quote":"we expect to have safety and preliminary efficacy data by the fourth quarter of this calendar year and transition the program to a, hopefully to a larger Phase 2 trial thereafter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf","timeframe":"Q4 2026"},{"claim":"The company expects to identify the maximum tolerated dose for SBO-154 by the end of the third quarter of 2026.","quote":"We expect, as I mentioned, to expect to have the maximum tolerated dose, or the MTD, identified by the end of the third quarter of 2026","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf","timeframe":"Q3 2026"},{"claim":"The company plans to initiate a global Phase 2 clinical study for SCD-153 in the second quarter of 2027.","quote":"we plan to initiate a global Phase 2 clinical study in the quarter 2 of the calendar year 2027.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-01-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=203be15c-b6fe-43e3-ab7e-4e2f5439364a.pdf","timeframe":"Q2 2027"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["annual_report","concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":10,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":7,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}